Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.23,0:00:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.23,0:00:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,In my opinion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Bulala is definitely in some special place
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s very special here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.96,0:00:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Strong wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.35,0:00:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Help
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.31,0:00:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:00:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,are you okay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.83,0:01:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like nothing here should be taken lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.67,0:01:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,what is that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.87,0:01:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Glowing Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.63,0:01:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be Golden Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.67,0:01:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m finally going to find the legendary Golden Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.35,0:01:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful and let me help you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.98,0:01:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,When did they become so close?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.19,0:01:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.63,0:01:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There seemed to be some sound just now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.62,0:01:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it just my imagination?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.58,0:01:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have heard wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.94,0:01:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.75,0:01:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,They are waiting for us
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.07,0:01:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.91,0:02:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, son. We’re almost at Goats’ Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.22,0:02:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,son
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.55,0:02:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be afraid, Mommy is here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about hurting them
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.51,0:02:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.11,0:02:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.31,0:02:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy. not good
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.16,0:02:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolnie and Wilie are attacked by a strange monster
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.92,0:02:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky has already rushed up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.80,0:02:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What monster
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.80,0:02:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s this monster
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.99,0:02:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.39,0:02:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to help him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.79,0:03:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.87,0:03:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.78,0:03:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids, it’s more dangerous for you to go out without weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.39,0:03:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about Wolnie and Wilie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie, take out all the inventions of Gogoa
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.22,0:03:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle Gogoa’s props were taken for maintenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.10,0:03:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the Mysterious Ocean weapon set invented by Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.34,0:03:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a short circuit due to water ingress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.18,0:03:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then now I can only come up with my own inventions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re talking about that invention
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,obey
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.69,0:03:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This monster is really difficult to deal with
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.34,0:03:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Sparky, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.14,0:03:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wilie, be relieved
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.42,0:03:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this monster possibly stump me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.41,0:04:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at my Sparky’s attack
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.10,0:04:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Golden Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.26,0:04:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you have it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.61,0:04:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The residents no longer have to be afraid of the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.85,0:04:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wish for many years
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.17,0:04:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,is finally coming true
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.41,0:04:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But how to use it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.46,0:04:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.61,0:04:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s strange. I’ve never seen such a monster before
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.21,0:04:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to be coming for Golden Bulala too
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.97,0:04:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Run quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.93,0:04:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m holding on here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.41,0:04:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys go quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.37,0:04:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.85,0:04:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Go quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,let me help you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.21,0:05:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.58,0:06:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Saving two handsome Weslies at once, cool
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.53,0:06:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.05,0:06:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,When it comes to rescuing people,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.21,0:06:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They are so in sync
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.30,0:06:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like they are the same person
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I underestimated you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I should get serious
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.88,0:07:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you have the two fragments, come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.03,0:07:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, Sparky’s weapon is ready
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.58,0:07:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,ready
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.62,0:07:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,emission
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.70,0:07:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Give my son back
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.95,0:07:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Give the Golden Bulala back
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.70,0:07:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to us
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.23,0:07:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Still not working
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.67,0:08:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,here we come
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.84,0:08:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, help pull it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.36,0:08:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to take the Golden Bulala out of its mouth
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it’s too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.98,0:08:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a shield, let me do it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.17,0:08:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s dangerous to do this
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.65,0:08:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.68,0:08:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.00,0:08:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back Sparky’s Golden Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.73,0:09:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want Golden Bulala anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.76,0:09:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly let go
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.65,0:09:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t know what courage was before
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.93,0:09:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Until I got to know you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.53,0:09:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I slowly began to understand
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.76,0:09:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I also have people I want to protect
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.01,0:09:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So I’m not afraid of anything anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.57,0:09:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,don’t touch him
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,let me go
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shrink!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.08,0:10:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about running away
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.93,0:10:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.00,0:10:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.92,0:10:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I only got one fragment
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.80,0:10:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,your hand
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.16,0:10:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s okay, just sew it up and it’ll be fine
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.04,0:10:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not want your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.16,0:11:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I couldn’t do it in the end
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.88,0:11:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness you’re alright
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.80,0:11:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems they really reconciled
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.16,0:11:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like they are better than before
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.24,0:11:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This weapon is so cool
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.80,0:11:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I defeated the monster alone
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.11,0:11:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, thank you for saving Wilie
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.81,0:11:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Sparky, your equipment is really powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.97,0:11:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s its name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.17,0:11:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know either
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.72,0:11:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I feel like it has a protagonist aura
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s call it the Protagonist’s Aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wilie
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.16,0:11:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Wilie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m fine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.41,0:11:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does the monster keep chasing Wilie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.32,0:11:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.44,0:12:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that this thing attracted the monster here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.55,0:12:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s take it back and show it to Mr. Slowy.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
